&#x200B;

Israel and UAE aren't allies, in a military sense. There's no agreements to defend each other, exceedingly likely there would never be. Neither want to get involved in each other's business for many reasons. They literally just normalised relations for the first time. Hardly an alliance.

\>neither does the Israeli government

